t", "title": "excluded workers"}], "description": "Students learn who is covered and what workers can do together for mutual aid or protection."}, {"id": "f7eab389-c7f8-4de5-a583-244446fd9304", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Unfair labor practices", "children": [{"id": "1212be85-f6b7-41c3-af4a-3ef668aad562", "type": "concept", "title": "Section 8(a)"}, {"id": "02850054-3d9c-41ae-a8c4-48fd44b057e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Section 8(b)"}, {"id": "3d8ac107-6c11-475b-9493-21718de61646", "type": "concept", "title": "interference"}, {"id": "1424e39f-825b-484d-9c09-c68a42ddec85", "type": "concept", "title": "discrimination"}, {"id": "ab571182-2bde-49f9-a390-e7ebb1d66d42", "type": "concept", "title": "bad-faith bargaining"}], "description": "Students learn the major employer and union violations that distort organizing, bargaining, or representation."}, {"id": "1cb8c01d-54bc-43c4-8734-e3749b01b29a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "NLRB process", "children": [{"id": "628fefb9-b4b4-4771-9eb7-2c46ab3f9e47", "type": "concept", "title": "regional offices"}, {"id": "444855e7-8bca-47d4-9285-2ed0bf644ab5", "type": "concept", "title": "charges"}, {"id": "8e3a8734-051a-4585-9033-c882d06ce342", "type": "concept", "title": "complaints"}, {"id": "5609ff35-658b-416a-8516-24046a883d45", "type": "concept", "title": "hearings"}, {"id": "88739985-e321-40dd-a090-ab9be34ea149", "type": "concept", "title": "Board decisions"}], "description": "The class maps how representation and unfair-labor-practice cases move through the agency."}]}, {"id": "73531610-9863-4738-b766-940da076b1c9", "type": "topic", "title": "Unions, Governance, Democracy, and Representation", "description": "Students learn that unions are organizations with internal rules, member politics, legal duties, and accountability structures.", "children": [{"id": "bcb76136-c71b-4a96-86f2-38592997e47b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Union structure", "children": [{"id": "d2f1beb2-bfb0-40f1-9577-c80a26b733e0", "type": "concept", "tit