"concept", "title": "excluded workers"}], "description": "Students learn who is covered and what workers can do together for mutual aid or protection."}, {"id": "f7eab389-c7f8-4de5-a583-244446fd9304", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Unfair labor practices", "children": [{"id": "1212be85-f6b7-41c3-af4a-3ef668aad562", "type": "concept", "title": "Section 8(a)"}, {"id": "02850054-3d9c-41ae-a8c4-48fd44b057e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Section 8(b)"}, {"id": "3d8ac107-6c11-475b-9493-21718de61646", "type": "concept", "title": "interference"}, {"id": "1424e39f-825b-484d-9c09-c68a42ddec85", "type": "concept", "title": "discrimination"}, {"id": "ab571182-2bde-49f9-a390-e7ebb1d66d42", "type": "concept", "title": "bad-faith bargaining"}], "description": "Students learn the major employer and union violations that distort organizing, bargaining, or representation."}, {"id": "1cb8c01d-54bc-43c4-8734-e3749b01b29a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "NLRB process", "children": [{"id": "628fefb9-b4b4-4771-9eb7-2c46ab3f9e47", "type": "concept", "title": "regional offices"}, {"id": "444855e7-8bca-47d4-9285-2ed0bf644ab5", "type": "concept", "title": "charges"}, {"id": "8e3a8734-051a-4585-9033-c882d06ce342", "type": "concept", "title": "complaints"}, {"id": "5609ff35-658b-416a-8516-24046a883d45", "type": "concept", "title": "hearings"}, {"id": "88739985-e321-40dd-a090-ab9be34ea149", "type": "concept", "title": "Board decisions"}], "description": "The class maps how representation and unfair-labor-practice cases move through the agency."}]}, {"id": "73531610-9863-4738-b766-940da076b1c9", "type": "topic", "title": "Unions, Governance, Democracy, and Representation", "description": "Students learn that unions are organizations with internal rules, member politics, legal duties, and accountability structures.", "children": [{"id": "bcb76136-c71b-4a96-86f2-38592997e47b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Union structure", "children": [{"id": "d2f1beb2-bfb0-40f1-9577-c80a26b733e0", "type": "concept", "title": "local unions"}, {"id": "d29b1f3f-5039-4bcb-ada0-93fa78840460", "type": "concept", "title": "international unions"}, {"id": "4953227e-9804-43b1-b474-cd8f9c1e3298", "type": "concept", "title": "AFL-CIO"}, {"id": "882f3923-001a-44c6-ad1e-0794437d478e", "type": "concept", "title": "bargaining units"}, {"id": "bc5ad714-2e70-46eb-bd54-111b017fec01", "type": "concept", "title": "union stewards"}], "description": "This subtopic explains locals, internationals, federations, bargaining units, stewards, and staff representatives."}, {"id": "d56703a4-086b-4199-9f3d-8ee7b9451df3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Internal democracy and accountability", "children": [{"id": "01b72693-9d4c-4a47-a98b-036aa5f71268", "type": "concept", "title": "LMRDA"}, {"id": "6311990b-4754-4cc1-8a7c-a94681bea467", "type": "concept", "title": "officer elections"}, {"id": "5bb4a316-09ac-461e-81c7-641d90f67e6d", "type": "concept", "title": "member rights"}, {"id": "7343f189-3987-4254-a52e-c82888822306", "type": "concept", "title": "contract ratification"}, {"id": "736f4c32-a7b7-4f95-b3b0-b32e4082aee8", "type": "concept", "title": "financial reporting"}], "description": "Students learn how members participate in elections, ratification, meetings, and leadership oversight."}, {"id": "5cf3f43f-2173-4012-8658-6f5e617d6a6c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Duty of fair representation", "children": [{"id": "6ebe9195-6a8d-4e09-8356-eefd6d53398b", "type": "concept", "title": "arbitrary conduct"}, {"id": "ba52026b-0d1e-46ac-8509-44eb0202f51e", "type": "concept", "title": "discrimination"}, {"id": "139222cf-fd61-46d6-9cb5-6197149658f2", "type": "concept", "title": "bad faith"}, {"id": "2da85206-b63d-4660-9fc0-4c26e3930079", "type": "concept", "title": "grievance discretion"}, {"id": "34bf601c-b515-4649-84f3-a1932dabda97", "type": "concept", "title": "member expectations"}], "description": "The class covers the union's legal duty to represent bargaining-unit members fairly and without arbitrary conduct."}]}, {"id": "6d3f6f35-27f4-4b9b-af4a-5e36a60bc49a", "type": "topic", "title": "Union Organizing, Campaigns, and Employer Conduct", "description": "This section prepares HR students to recognize organizing dynamics and keep employer responses lawful, credible, and ethically defensible.", "children": [{"id": "b14bf373-bf6b-455b-a023-ee67f178e26e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Organizing strategy", "children": [{"id": "e95bc332-b8a6-4903-b92e-6d666591719a", "type": "concept", "title": "authorization cards"}, {"id": "25d42a15-301d-44aa-aa18-44b981dfbf67", "type": "concept", "title": "organizing committees"}, {"id": "962f28d7-da60-41f6-a27b-625a3d05aee5", "type": "concept", "title": "workplace mapping"}, {"id": "8ac8008d-e762-4030-ac9d-7c2116bde63a", "type": "concept", "title": "salting"}, {"id": "96475672-2c8c-4a3b-ba08-63eb73ed0623", "type": "concept", "title": "digital organizing"}], "description": "Students learn how campaigns build support, identify issues, map workplaces, and mobilize employees."}, {"id": "c8109a5f-421c-41c0-b662-bb53f0058177", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Representation procedures", "children": [{"id": "f431bdd0-5309-4d1d-a88e-163ecd94e848", "type": "concept", "title": "petitions"}, {"id": "6600ac40-0047-4e58-b48c-37dd21a51a35", "type": "concept", "title": "showing of interest"}, {"id": "ebf8bfac-71d8-4c54-8ff9-6bb308f3e58e", "type": "concept", "title": "unit determination"}, {"id": "260fa37a-dfbe-4f70-833a-7680c2b2f030", "type": "concept", "title": "secret-ballot elections"}, {"id": "9e40317a-02cf-48e8-aac8-49c74c0d6c98", "type": "concept", "title": "certification"}], "description": "The class examines elections, card-check arrangements, bargaining-unit disputes, and campaign objections."}, {"id": "708ea763-acfe-48db-929f-7ad6cf87220b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Lawful employer conduct", "children": [{"id": "fbf91317-df98-4464-b923-a491edbe23b1", "type": "concept", "title": "TIPS framework"}, {"id": "4a7abad5-a174-4159-a5d3-dbc6b7db81dc", "type": "concept", "title": "supervisor training"}, {"id": "c10ff3c5-36e3-4455-9d0c-938324759006", "type": "concept", "title": "neutrality agreements"}, {"id": "e1a7aef3-5dc5-45d8-8545-896dc38e122a", "type": "concept", "title": "captive-audience issues"}, {"id": "1a632a1e-adc1-4a08-96f6-3a24123163f7", "type": "concept", "title": "message discipline"}], "description": "Students learn how to communicate without threats, interrogation, promises, surveillance, or retaliation."}]}, {"id": "3186f4c8-d1fc-465d-acbc-a094ec810206", "type": "topic", "title": "Labor Economics, Power, and Strategic Context", "description": "Students learn why bargaining outcomes depend on economic conditions, institutional rules, labor-market power, public support, and organizational strategy.", "children": [{"id": "a89e0c85-2571-4773-9309-5a8255765385", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Labor-market context", "children": [{"id": "26279c8a-7f5b-42ff-96e9-ad7996275924", "type": "concept", "title": "wage premiums"}, {"id": "b39a571b-a88f-4e4f-a09c-8e78f8a13f21", "type": "concept", "title": "monopsony"}, {"id": "b6c822c1-cf80-4041-a71e-39f40d85acd4", "type": "concept", "title": "productivity"}, {"id": "92e1c8f2-640a-4ec6-99a9-5da378e12c49", "type": "concept", "title": "labor share"}, {"id": "1256d934-c995-48eb-b11f-d3fd95bb0f26", "type": "concept", "title": "inequality"}], "description": "This subtopic connects unions to wages, benefits, turnover, inequality, and labor-market structure."}, {"id": "cdca18be-fcdd-4efb-a58c-a83528f12ed4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Bargaining power", "children": [{"id": "42e1077d-f94e-430b-9d0e-29b4b9f15778", "type": "concept", "title": "strike threat"}, {"id": "d2f9591c-a2d8-4617-b4d2-53bd3f39aac3", "type": "concept", "title": "replacement workers"}, {"id": "f305764a-f787-40f8-a21a-61962ad8c252", "type": "concept", "title": "public opinion"}, {"id": "b81bd59a-7e63-4ecb-9245-5c33c4373296", "type": "concept", "title": "financial reserves"}, {"id": "b901505f-6c1f-4839-92