kplace Implementation", "description": "This section shows how collective bargaining agreements become daily workplace governance systems.", "children": [{"id": "48d40e21-f11c-43b9-9ecc-2c01fb544436", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Core contract clauses", "children": [{"id": "6b7a1fcd-0a44-4614-8fcc-e022e8501a1a", "type": "concept", "title": "recognition"}, {"id": "4f62d44a-c5fb-4e1e-a079-6daf19d06f8e", "type": "concept", "title": "management rights"}, {"id": "c6c300f8-86e1-4af0-a2da-7dc6291c9c57", "type": "concept", "title": "union security"}, {"id": "a3377408-22ec-4bfe-b704-25f32081de71", "type": "concept", "title": "seniority"}, {"id": "b43020f6-5f71-449d-acd9-e84f5c4e30d4", "type": "concept", "title": "no-strike clauses"}], "description": "Students learn the meaning and tradeoffs in common collective bargaining agreement provisions."}, {"id": "e23b9cb1-3ad5-4adc-8b61-018d8293e094", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Work rules and operations", "children": [{"id": "6e288cf9-dc49-4ccc-9c23-5a927ab066b8", "type": "concept", "title": "scheduling"}, {"id": "9e20edf9-e302-4023-98b2-9a9f4d979bca", "type": "concept", "title": "overtime distribution"}, {"id": "ab875302-ac1e-481f-9f43-b1dc0fa70998", "type": "concept", "title": "job bidding"}, {"id": "c8de656f-147f-4147-816b-f5c4ce3ed36a", "type": "concept", "title": "subcontracting"}, {"id": "0c7dc1db-1e89-411f-814b-fd57f5e4aed8", "type": "concept", "title": "safety committees"}], "description": "The class connects contract language to scheduling, overtime, classification, subcontracting, safety, and discipline."}, {"id": "6039f1da-c4c9-4050-a9db-a3e73780bd65", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Administration systems", "children": [{"id": "66c8f870-766e-4d58-b50b-5b1752f2c44e", "type": "concept", "title": "contract interpretation"}, {"id": "927a8c75-596f-46a5-b5a3-9706cf2d781e", "type": "concept", "title": "past practice"}, {"id": "769052a9-098a-45e2-b1e0-162876f62220", "type": "concept", "title": "labor-management meetings"}, {"id": "aedf6c71-b630-4b51-8ff3-8381fb1fa5ee", "type": "concept", "title": "supervisor training"}, {"id": "26d58a33-be85-4478-a0ba-2dd486ee8260", "type": "concept", "title": "documentation"}], "description": "Students learn how HR, supervisors, stewards, and managers keep contract implementation consistent."}]}, {"id": "35428132-60b9-4af9-b4d6-3c9154bf860b", "type": "topic", "title": "Grievance Handling, Just Cause, and Arbitration", "description": "Students learn how workplace disputes are processed, documented, argued, and resolved under a collective bargaining agreement.", "children": [{"id": "a4b02877-c642-460b-b93e-73fc685b962e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Grievance procedure", "children": [{"id": "19e356ec-36e2-40cc-acdf-ef47c3429a4f", "type": "concept", "title": "filing timelines"}, {"id": "a7c900fa-178d-40b2-8d2c-773cdde8a02d", "type": "concept", "title": "step meetings"}, {"id": "2f2e6361-9394-4dc7-9bf5-edc9d7d8792f", "type": "concept", "title": "steward roles"}, {"id": "ca4dd110-f9d3-401c-baf5-ee6165f30989", "type": "concept", "title": "settlement authority"}, {"id": "f7efacd8-1314-405e-b89f-2b02510e9a23", "type": "concept", "title": "withdrawals"}], "description": "This subtopic maps the steps, timelines, parties, and evidence needed to process grievances well."}, {"id": "b327e95e-04bd-43d5-92a1-85304cae285e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Just cause and discipline", "children": [{"id": "8e9723e4-108d-403d-8f31-0d0d2d43f9f1", "type": "concept", "title": "notice"}, {"id": "3dd520d6-3d0b-4226-b8dd-7db8df34dc8d", "type": "concept", "title": "reasonable rule"}, {"id": "7aedff20-d9a4-4b14-b070-5f17bdde8c84", "type": "concept", "title": "investigation"}, {"id": "22092efe-60d7-43eb-a874-de3174684cc8", "type": "concept", "title": "proof"}, {"id": "9e88cfdd-9607-4d8a-9db5-9a7758a7567b", "type": "concept", "title": "proportionality"}], "description": "Students learn the fairness standards arbitrators use to evaluate discipline and discharge."}, {"id": "619733a1-4965-488f-b206-05cc17366a8c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Arbitration advocacy", "children": [{"id": "5153e8a4-9a9b-4d21-90a7-e117b4131e13", "type": "concept", "title": "opening statements"}, {"id": "8c497143-4b6f-481d-865c-a6d067dd8b84", "type": "concept", "title": "witness preparation"}, {"id": "63b4d1aa-844f-420b-92d3-172d81f5eb05", "type": "concept", "title": "document evidence"}, {"id": "d53d6272-c4f5-4ad1-85b8-7a5f6647a29e", "type": "concept", "title": "arbitrator authority"}, {"id": "827c1e27-1fba-4433-9bcd-7dd8d03a16f9", "type": "concept", "title": "make-whole remedies"}], "description": "The class introduces hearing preparation, evidence, witnesses, briefs, awards, and remedies."}]}, {"id": "113a14b9-3a95-40d1-bc03-bfcfaa92bbcc", "type": "topic", "title": "Strikes, Lockouts, Impasse, Mediation, and Dispute Resolution", "description": "This unit teaches students how conflict escalates and how skilled labor-relations professionals prevent, manage, or resolve breakdowns.", "children": [{"id": "651735c9-c087-4837-ad54-e82640ef845e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Economic weapons", "children": [{"id": "ce75738e-c2e7-4360-9e4a-d7fddf4f9050", "type": "concept", "title": "economic strikes"}, {"id": "847f8f86-5f39-4ed4-b83a-8eada6dfeac0", "type": "concept", "title": "unfair-labor-practice strikes"}, {"id": "4ead4e30-cfc4-41bd-9c1c-33b3344e084c", "type": "concept", "title": "lockouts"}, {"id": "c489ec6b-e409-4095-a6fe-a1a8a6b3f343", "type": "concept", "title": "picketing"}, {"id": "2362ce71-5b9a-4aab-b6d4-dcde72b7c701", "type": "concept", "title": "replacement workers"}], "description": "Students learn the legal and strategic role of strikes, lockouts, picketing, boycotts, and replacement workers."}, {"id": "fd8347f4-418f-4832-9438-034fc830a405", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Third-party dispute resolution", "children": [{"id": "bb7455e5-2cde-4a20-b158-d6d3e5d6b611", "type": "concept", "title": "FMCS mediation"}, {"id": "71a70d73-4a0e-495b-9603-8f0faf79c241", "type": "